      "description": "The site config version each process runs with. With the config in the database, all instances converge on the same version within seconds of a change; a lasting difference means an instance cannot reload it (its logs say why). With `SOURCEGULL_SITE_CONFIG_FILE`, versions count reloads per process and may differ.",
